{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "libertos-engine-pipeline",
  "title": "Libertos / Engine pipeline",
  "description": "Libertos engine operations. TODO panels identify telemetry that is not exported. No data is not zero.",
  "tags": [
    "libertos",
    "engine"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "schemaVersion": 40,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {
    "refresh_intervals": [
      "1m",
      "5m",
      "15m"
    ]
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Engine pipeline",
      "url": "/d/libertos-engine-pipeline",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Archive sweep",
      "url": "/d/libertos-archive-sweep",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Cost",
      "url": "/d/libertos-cost",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    },
    {
      "type": "link",
      "title": "Briefing drill-down",
      "url": "/d/libertos-briefing-drilldown",
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Telemetry coverage",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Completed jobs are exported today. Job duration includes queue time and retries. These charts do not prove that a briefing was delivered.\n\n**TODO · engineOtel:** per-step spans, stuck state, delivery outcome and deadline metrics. Empty charts mean no matching exported samples. Check the drill-down before treating silence as health."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Briefing job completions per rolling hour",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
      },
      "description": "Completed briefing jobs, grouped by the outcome encoded in the current span name. Counter extrapolation can produce fractional counts. Does not count deliveries.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (label_replace(increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"libertos-convex\",span_name=~\"eve[.]job[.]briefing (succeeded|failed|cancelled)\"}[1h]), \"outcome\", \"$1\", \"span_name\", \".* (succeeded|failed|cancelled)\"))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Completed job failures per rolling hour",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
      },
      "description": "Completed job errors. Detailed step and error-code breakdown awaits engineOtel; current error.type is only job_failed.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus-home-cluster"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (span_name) (increase(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=\"libertos-convex\",span_name=~\"eve[.]job[.].*\",status_code=\"STATUS_CODE_ERROR\"}[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{span_name}}",
          "range": true,
          "instant": false,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "TODO · Step duration p50 / p95",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Waiting for engineOtel's step spans or histogram. Existing job spans cannot measure individual engine steps.\n\nTempo's current histogram ends at 16.384 seconds and would understate long jobs."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "TODO · Failures by step and error code",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Blocked on bounded step and error-code attributes. The existing job_failed error classification does not identify the failing step. No raw error messages, reader text or private lane names belong in metric labels."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "TODO · Briefings stuck over 15 minutes",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires a periodically exported active-job count and age since last progress, cleared on completion or cancellation. Terminal spans alone cannot detect a job that never finishes. Alert blocked on engineOtel / stuckWatch."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "TODO · On-time delivery per reader morning",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Requires delivery outcomes against the reader's onboarding/profile timezone and scheduled deadline. A succeeded job is not an on-time delivery. Export counts and lateness, never reader timezone guesses or preferences. Late/short delivery alert is blocked."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Recent engine job traces",
      "type": "table",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{ resource.service.name = \"libertos-convex\" && name =~ \"eve[.]job[.].*\" }",
          "limit": 30,
          "tableType": "traces"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Briefing drill-down",
                    "url": "/d/libertos-briefing-drilldown?var-traceId=${__value.raw}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm"
      }
    }
  ]
}
